        "why": "Atomic Redis Lua scripts execute check-and-decrement logic in memory within microseconds, completely bypassing relational database row-lock contention.",
        "explanation": "Atomic Redis Lua scripts execute check-and-decrement logic in memory within microseconds, completely bypassing relational database row-lock contention."
