        "answer": 0,
        "answerIndex": 0,
        "why": "Separation of Duties ensures that requisition authors cannot approve their own purchases, satisfying corporate governance and SOX compliance.",
        "explanation": "Separation of Duties ensures that requisition authors cannot approve their own purchases, satisfying corporate governance and SOX compliance."
